Your save game disk is full. You must either use another disk or save over an existing saved game.	你的存檔磁碟已滿。你必須換一片磁碟，或覆蓋現有的存檔。
That game was saved under a different interpreter. It cannot be restored.	該存檔是在不同的直譯器下建立的，無法讀取。
