DESIGNED BY: Christy Marx  ILLUSTRATED BY: Peter Ledger & Douglas Herring with Kenn Nishiuye, Jennifer Shontz, Andy Hoyos, and Julian Ledger  PROGRAMMED BY: David Slayback, Bob Fischbach, Eric Hart with Jerry Shaw and Doug Oldfield  MUSIC BY: Mark Seibert  Version %s	設計：Christy Marx  繪圖：Peter Ledger 與 Douglas Herring，協同 Kenn Nishiuye、Jennifer Shontz、Andy Hoyos、Julian Ledger  程式：David Slayback、Bob Fischbach、Eric Hart，協同 Jerry Shaw 與 Doug Oldfield  音樂：Mark Seibert  版本 %s
PRODUCER Guruka Singh Khalsa  DEVELOPMENT SYSTEM BY: Jeff Stephenson, Robert E. Heitman, Pablo Ghenis  QUALITY ASSURANCE BY: Mindy Wynn: QA Team Leader Robin Bradley, Oliver Brelsford, Steve Collier, Tate Deloach, Mike Harian, Dennis Jonathan, Dean Larocca, Sharon Simmons 	製作人：Guruka Singh Khalsa  開發系統：Jeff Stephenson、Robert E. Heitman、Pablo Ghenis  品保：Mindy Wynn（品保組長）、Robin Bradley、Oliver Brelsford、Steve Collier、Tate Deloach、Mike Harian、Dennis Jonathan、Dean Larocca、Sharon Simmons 
Use arrow keys or mouse to move to a location. Press ENTER or  double click on the left button to go to the location. 	使用方向鍵或滑鼠移動至地點。按下 ENTER 鍵，或以滑鼠左鍵點兩下，即可前往該地。 
      DURING THE GAME: Click at the top of the screen or press ESC to use the menus. Additional shortcuts are shown there.       IN TYPING WINDOWS: Arrows, Home and End move the cursor, or click anywhere with the mouse. Ctrl-C clears the line.       IN DIALOG WINDOWS: Select the outlined item with <Enter> and use Tab and Shift-Tab to move between choices. Or click with the mouse to select an item.  ESC always cancels. 	      遊戲進行中：點擊螢幕頂端，或按 ESC 鍵開啟選單，選單上會列出其他快速鍵。       輸入視窗中：方向鍵、Home 與 End 可移動游標，或以滑鼠點擊任意處，Ctrl-C 可清空整行。       對話視窗中：以 <Enter> 鍵選取外框標示的項目，並用 Tab 與 Shift-Tab 在選項間切換，或以滑鼠點擊選取項目。  ESC 鍵永遠可以取消。 
 Do you really want to    restart your game?	 你確定要    重新開始這場遊戲嗎？
